  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2778,
      "text": "“Were not My verses recited to you, and you used to reject them?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 105,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 349,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2779,
      "text": "They will say, “Our Lord, our misfortune overwhelmed us, and we were a people who went astray.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 106,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 349,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2780,
      "text": "Our Lord, take us out of this; if we returned [to evil], we would certainly be wrongdoers.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 107,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 349,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2781,
      "text": "Allah will say, “Stay therein despised and do not speak to Me[48].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 108,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 349,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2782,
      "text": "There was a group of My slaves who used to pray, ‘Our Lord, we believe, so forgive us and have mercy upon us, and You are the Most Merciful of those who show mercy.’",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 109,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 349,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2783,
      "text": "But you took them in mockery until they made you forget My remembrance, and you used to laugh at them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 110,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 349,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2784,
      "text": "I have rewarded them Today for their patience; it is they who are the successful.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 111,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 349,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2785,
      "text": "He will say, “How many years did you stay on earth?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 112,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 349,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2786,
      "text": "They will say, “We stayed for a day or part of a day; ask those who keep count.”[49]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 113,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 349,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2787,
      "text": "Allah will say, “You only stayed for a while, if only you had known[50].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 114,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 349,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2788,
      "text": "Did you think that We created you with no purpose and that you would not be brought back to Us?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 115,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 349,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2789,
      "text": "Exalted is Allah, the True Sovereign[51]! None has the right to be worshiped except Him, the Lord of the Honorable Throne.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 116,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 349,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2790,
      "text": "Whoever invokes another god besides Allah, for which he has no proof, his reckoning will be with his Lord[52]. Indeed, the disbelievers will never succeed.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 117,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 349,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2791,
      "text": "Say, “My Lord, forgive and have mercy, and you are the Best of those who show mercy.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
